<BaseLayout title="Transmission" description="Manual and automatic transmission options for LS Genesis Coupe swaps.">
  <h1>Transmission</h1>
  <p>
    The Gen Coupe accepts both manual and automatic LS transmissions with the correct adapter, crossmember, and driveshaft.
  </p>

  <h2>Common Pairings</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>T56 Magnum XL</strong> — most popular manual. Both 2.66 and 2.97 first-gear versions are used. Requires a clutch alignment tool (RAM 26-spline) and pilot bushing (McLeod MRR 8-1094-2 is commonly referenced).</li>
    <li><strong>4L60E / 4L80E</strong> — common automatic choices. 4L80E is stronger for higher power.</li>
    <li><strong>6L80E</strong> — later automatic option with better gearing.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Driveshaft length and yoke type change with the transmission choice. Measure twice.
  </p>

